    37	> \(\overline{\mathbb Q}\); NOT A PAIR, NOT A CANONICAL LIFT.**
    38	
    39	Such a survivor would not be a Keller pair and would not provide the missing
    40	triangular lift to the canonical approximate-root recursion.
    41	
    42	## 1. Frozen custody, fleet, and disk discipline
    43	
    44	I mechanically built the six-line manifest from the indexed
    45	`charged_input_<i>_basename=` and `charged_input_<i>_sha256=` receipt fields
    46	with `awk`, then ran `sha256sum -c` against
    47	`/tmp/jc2-lane.wiULJu/inputs`. All six returned `OK`:
    48	
    49	| frozen input | SHA-256 |
    50	|---|---|
    51	| `t2t3-chain-sol56-20260906.md` | `d85ae785c992e73a38d84b73a5fcadee48342844b2fadfe2a5d13082d5a6c45b` |
    52	| `char-degree-instrument-astra-r2-20260905.md` | `d9b95ce9c4588104c9f306d987f91957988611b80d2025a05f14c40568e33b45` |
    53	| `cone-vertex-gate-opus5-20260905.md` | `72dfcd371f338767e303c6da0eab02337f257ad29409a9fc6b60cd2e85c20ecd` |
    54	| `fleet.sh` | `a9da94d341a691942e9d6a6a6d90d97008b2d7baa1cadb2592481cf6b9c11c4c` |
    55	| `dispatch.sh` | `dd1e148c9a0bdf2f7de0bd80a249c743d985a26f982245a375824ca89e4bc599` |
    56	| `FALLACY-v2.md` | `e47fd16cfcc91bc7bfdac4ba1b5f46152db8235e6609dca6e29a5966549c38f5` |
    57	
    58	There was no mismatch. I used no `ideation-*` input, made no ledger edit, did
    59	not use `jc2-lean`, and did not modify a charged input.
    60	
    61	Exactly one worker was launched with the requested command:
    62	
    63	```text
    64	bash ops/fleet/fleet.sh launch 1 r7i.16xlarge
    65	```
    66	
    67	Instance `i-0fc259ff68e914869`, private IP `172.30.0.55`, launched at
    68	2026-09-06 02:34:38 UTC. It reported 64 logical CPUs and 532,326,535,168
    69	bytes of RAM. Provisioning completed before use. The installed executables
    70	were msolve 0.10.1 at SHA-256
    71	`0436525b06fe83b1a6a00097a96d9bcafdc40d8de6315c724b9ada9a4c04ff5f`
    72	and Singular 4.3.2 at
    73	`90ab699b7a28486944a167e797d7c8dd38f8f949960b93ee7a6d08ff1c7c46f4`.
    74	
    75	All expansion and solver work ran on that worker with run-local `TMPDIR`.
    76	No large presentation, basis, or CAS log was copied back. The host retains
    77	only this report, drivers, and compact JSON under
    78	`box/t2t3-direct-20260906/`; the final persistent byte count is recorded in
    79	§ 9 and is below 2 MB.
    80	
    81	## 2. Compressor
    82	
    83	Keep Moh's order reversal explicit:
    84	
    85	\[
    86	 \widehat T_i(F,G)=T_i^\psi(G,F),\qquad
    87	 B_i={\partial\widehat T_i\over\partial G},\qquad
    88	 J(F,\widehat T_i)=B_iJ(F,G).                    \tag{2.1}
    89	\]
    90	
    91	For the two degree pairs the exact characteristic data are
    92	
    93	\[
    94	 (M,d,D)=((-66,77,97),(99,33,11,1),(66,55,145))
    95	\]
    96	
    97	and
    98	
    99	\[
   100	 (M,d,D)=((-72,81,106),(108,36,9,1),(72,63,227)).
   101	\]
   102	
   103	The complete constant-target second characteristic family is
   104	
   105	\[
   106	 \widehat T_2=G^3-F^2+aG^2+bFG+cF+dG+e_0,
   107	 \qquad B_2=3G^2+2aG+bF+d.
   108	\]
   109	
   110	Its leading \(3G^2\) cannot cancel, so \(\deg B_2=2m\). Total-degree
   111	attainment and (2.1) give, for \(j\ne0\),
   112	
   113	\[
   114	 \deg j\le n+D_2-2-2m=20\quad\hbox{or}\quad25.
   115	\]
   116	
   117	At \(T_3\), Proposition 3.2 gives
   118	\(\deg_yB_3=D_3+M_3=242\) or 333, exactly the upper bound

