+**Hostile promotion gate: attained T₂/T₃ compressor and direct presentation**
+
+**A — CONFIRMED-WITH-FIX. B — CONFIRMED-WITH-FIX. The frozen report is not promotable verbatim.** The compressor, circuit quotient isomorphism, nonzero-generator counts, and literal-subset unit implication survive. The full frozen builder has a definite completion bug. Correct the source citations and total-degree hypotheses, distinguish the two meanings of “Theorem B,” and withdraw the categorical claim that a proper *complete* direct ideal could not yield a Keller pair. No chart kill has been computed: the charged harvest establishes two timeouts and leaves the chart **OPEN**.
