+**The compressor.** Moh’s target order is `(f,g)=(G,F)`, with `deg F=deg_y F=n`, `deg G=deg_y G=m`. Put `Q=T₂^ψ(G,F)`, `W=T₃^ψ(G,F)`, `B_i=(∂T_i^ψ/∂f)(G,F)`. Then
